{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763740/extras/6b48ec846c816b7f112f4029041191f2.avif?t=1761524505\" width=1232 height=706 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>You\u2019re not solving the mystery... you\u2019re reliving it!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Artifact Protocol</i> is a first-person psychological horror game where every artifact traps you in the <strong>final moments of someone else\u2019s life</strong>. You play as Anthony, an imprisoned ex-soldier forced into a classified testing program, promised freedom if you can survive. One by one, you\u2019re sent into reconstructed memories of the dead, each trial a different nightmare.But the deeper you go, the less you\u2019re sure if you\u2019re living their memories\u2026 or your own.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>This isn't no ordinary horror... </strong>this is not a safe dream, it\u2019s a trap built from tortured minds. Most who enter never return, <strong>even veteran horror fans have failed to survive even the first artifact... can you?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763740/extras/ff3c2021382b0145c3ce7fbe4ac1b370.poster.avif?t=1761524505\" width=1170 height=242 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763740/extras/ff3c2021382b0145c3ce7fbe4ac1b370.webm?t=1761524505\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763740/extras/ff3c2021382b0145c3ce7fbe4ac1b370.mp4?t=1761524505\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What To Expect</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Five Nightmares In One:</strong> Each artifact is a standalone nightmare with its own setting, monster, and psychological theme.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging Survival:</strong>\u00a0Most who enter don\u2019t escape the first artifact.\u00a0No handholding,\u00a0no walking simulator,\u00a0only your wits and your will to survive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Custom Voice Acting &amp; Story-Driven Experience:</strong> Every trial is brought to life with original voice performances and a narrative that unfolds through atmosphere, sound, and discovery.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep Environmental Storytelling</strong>: Learn each victim\u2019s story through living it, not just watching it.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adaptive Monster AI</strong>: No two encounters feel the same. Each creature learns, reacts, and hunts in its own terrifying way.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763740/extras/0eb6f42abf83e8a892f4d3e5e4c1b84b.poster.avif?t=1761524505\" width=1170 height=242 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763740/extras/0eb6f42abf83e8a892f4d3e5e4c1b84b.webm?t=1761524505\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763740/extras/0eb6f42abf83e8a892f4d3e5e4c1b84b.mp4?t=1761524505\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Replay Value Beyond the Main Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Completing the main story unlocks new layers of horror:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nightmare Mode: </strong>A brutal one-life challenge with a <strong>new &quot;Observer&quot;</strong> and <strong>exclusive</strong> narrative voice lines that reveal hidden lore.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Challenge Gamemodes: </strong>Extra challenge trials that push your survival skills even further.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763740/extras/16b3d5adc15db8d1e9cba4d3458e446a.poster.avif?t=1761524505\" width=1170 height=243 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763740/extras/16b3d5adc15db8d1e9cba4d3458e446a.webm?t=1761524505\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THEMES &amp; TONE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn\u2019t about cheap jumpscares. <i>The Artifact Protocol</i> is built on <strong>dread, loss, and fractured identity</strong>... horror that lingers long after you\u2019ve shut the game down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Artifact Protocol</strong> is designed as an intense horror experience you can survive in one sitting, with new modes and hidden story layers waiting to pull you back...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763740/extras/c90e86614c9944dda25e81cad09f8a22.poster.avif?t=1761524505\" width=1170 height=242 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763740/extras/c90e86614c9944dda25e81cad09f8a22.webm?t=1761524505\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763740/extras/c90e86614c9944dda25e81cad09f8a22.mp4?t=1761524505\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Case Closed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3763740/f293b8d7620005fc3cac1fe00a5cb67a40374041.jpg"},{"name":"Cold Case","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3763740/34958447e26b88dce50967d7ef17650c8df62802.jpg"},{"name":"Echoes of the Mind","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3763740/f563ee7208a32e3a3e80903c9473edddebc482df.jpg"},{"name":"Tried the Exit","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3763740/1aeb30968e18e95dc87625e1ea5bd9a702630674.jpg"},{"name":"Took a Dive","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3763740/6e093e5a01ee8074489198794fdb94396e343968.jpg"},{"name":"Good Girl","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3763740/323c3225c9f0ec80462b2a766a3f85f36e0cb189.jpg"},{"name":"Forever Playtime","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3763740/d3a131d3ece2d308103f558704010b13a371bdd7.jpg"},{"name":"Toybox Tomb","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3763740/8377176a265e38e2aa36fe8f7e91a2e11fcdc426.jpg"},{"name":"Bag of Goodies","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3763740/a17c16f8398d02d4d22c643ea51c7a605716276a.jpg"},{"name":"The Angels Are Weeping\u2026 YOU BLINKED!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3763740/5d4d4174db19b6abbc534d77b99633aad71d4b77.jpg"}],"total":37},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3763740?t=1761524505","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763740/88e3287bae83f5c7792be9cce165e6e614643512/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761524505","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763740/a932307361c6370a4bb95273c98bf2ed84c2cad3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761524505","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763740/a932307361c6370a4bb95273c98bf2ed84c2cad3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761524505","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"The Artifact Protocol is a psychological horror experience intended for mature audiences with unsettling environments, tense encounters, and occasional depictions of blood and violence.\r\n\r\nPlayers will encounter depictions of death, blood, and disturbing imagery throughout its five story-driven trials. The game focuses on psychological tension and contains sequences designed to cause fear and unease.\r\n\r\nThere are two parts of the story that include narrative-driven acts of suicide/self-sacrifice. These moments are portrayed as deliberate choices made by the player/characters to stop greater threats and are framed in a serious, narrative context rather than for shock value. The scenes do not linger on explicit detail but can remain emotionally intense.\r\n\r\nThe game\u2019s themes include trauma, loss, sacrifice, and survival under extreme circumstances. Levels feature disturbing environments and hostile creatures that reinforce these themes. Players who are sensitive to psychological trauma, gore, or depictions of death should approach with caution.\r\n\r\nThere is no sexual content or depictions of sexual assault in any way. Dialogue contains occasional strong language. Player discretion is strongly advised."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763740/extras/6b48ec846c816b7f112f4029041191f2.avif?t=1761524505\" width=1232 height=706 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>You\u2019re not solving the mystery... you\u2019re reliving it!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Artifact Protocol</i> is a first-person psychological horror game where every artifact traps you in the <strong>final moments of someone else\u2019s life</strong>. You play as Anthony, an imprisoned ex-soldier forced into a classified testing program, promised freedom if you can survive. One by one, you\u2019re sent into reconstructed memories of the dead, each trial a different nightmare.But the deeper you go, the less you\u2019re sure if you\u2019re living their memories\u2026 or your own.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>This isn't no ordinary horror... </strong>this is not a safe dream, it\u2019s a trap built from tortured minds. Most who enter never return, <strong>even veteran horror fans have failed to survive even the first artifact... can you?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763740/extras/ff3c2021382b0145c3ce7fbe4ac1b370.poster.avif?t=1761524505\" width=1170 height=242 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763740/extras/ff3c2021382b0145c3ce7fbe4ac1b370.webm?t=1761524505\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763740/extras/ff3c2021382b0145c3ce7fbe4ac1b370.mp4?t=1761524505\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What To Expect</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Five Nightmares In One:</strong> Each artifact is a standalone nightmare with its own setting, monster, and psychological theme.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging Survival:</strong>\u00a0Most who enter don\u2019t escape the first artifact.\u00a0No handholding,\u00a0no walking simulator,\u00a0only your wits and your will to survive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Custom Voice Acting &amp; Story-Driven Experience:</strong> Every trial is brought to life with original voice performances and a narrative that unfolds through atmosphere, sound, and discovery.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep Environmental Storytelling</strong>: Learn each victim\u2019s story through living it, not just watching it.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adaptive Monster AI</strong>: No two encounters feel the same. Each creature learns, reacts, and hunts in its own terrifying way.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763740/extras/0eb6f42abf83e8a892f4d3e5e4c1b84b.poster.avif?t=1761524505\" width=1170 height=242 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763740/extras/0eb6f42abf83e8a892f4d3e5e4c1b84b.webm?t=1761524505\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763740/extras/0eb6f42abf83e8a892f4d3e5e4c1b84b.mp4?t=1761524505\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Replay Value Beyond the Main Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Completing the main story unlocks new layers of horror:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nightmare Mode: </strong>A brutal one-life challenge with a <strong>new &quot;Observer&quot;</strong> and <strong>exclusive</strong> narrative voice lines that reveal hidden lore.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Challenge Gamemodes: </strong>Extra challenge trials that push your survival skills even further.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763740/extras/16b3d5adc15db8d1e9cba4d3458e446a.poster.avif?t=1761524505\" width=1170 height=243 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763740/extras/16b3d5adc15db8d1e9cba4d3458e446a.webm?t=1761524505\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THEMES &amp; TONE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn\u2019t about cheap jumpscares. <i>The Artifact Protocol</i> is built on <strong>dread, loss, and fractured identity</strong>... horror that lingers long after you\u2019ve shut the game down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Artifact Protocol</strong> is designed as an intense horror experience you can survive in one sitting, with new modes and hidden story layers waiting to pull you back...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763740/extras/c90e86614c9944dda25e81cad09f8a22.poster.avif?t=1761524505\" width=1170 height=242 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamsta